    "advanced_content_U3KpaT": {
      "type": "advanced-content",
      "blocks": {
        "liquid_rMTGjz": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>COTS</h2><p>COTS creates opportunities for families to collaborate, thrive, and succeed in building strong and stable households, neighborhoods, and communities. Through partnerships, they are able to assist families in reaching their housing, economic, health, education, and career goals as they overcome homelessness and break the cycle of poverty for the next generation and beyond. COTS is creating opportunities to succeed.</p><a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/blogs/blog/creating-opportunities-to-succeed\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-link\">Learn More</a>",
            "width": "66%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "image_4MEgQF": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
