            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "liquid_ydaffT": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>Glimmer In The Dark</h2><p>Glimmer in the Dark is a non-profit on a mission to spread love and connection to new widows by gifting a thoughtful piece of jewelry on Valentine’s Day. Through this heartfelt gesture, we aim to remind them that they are cherished and never alone, even in the absence of their loved ones. We believe that these tokens of love can uplift their spirits, bring comfort, and foster a sense of connection during a challenging time.\n</b></p>\n</p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1k-rlaCn8XLSh3D71dz5iVPhBhIcXNkYf1AAJPkGGMYc/viewform?pli=1&ts=67895503&pli=1&edit_requested=true\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-link\">Nominate a Widow</a>",
            "width": "66%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        }
      },
