      "blocks": {
        "liquid_3nYYUB": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<p>Rebel Nell is proud to have obtained certifications from two distinct organizations, SEWF and the Women’s Business Enterprise National Council. These certifications validate our ongoing efforts to create impact while producing quality products.\n\nThe SEWF Certified Social Enterprise is an independent guarantee that we put the interests of people and the planet above shareholder gain.\n\nWe are verified as a Women’s Business Enterprise (WBE) and Women-Owned Small Business (WOSB) through the Women’s Business Enterprise National Council, the nation’s largest third-party certifier of businesses owned and operated by women in the US.</p>",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
